Error [jet.EffectBoundExceeded]: `backup` uses the effect `Bucket{name: "logs"}`, which its signature doesn't allow
  --> Tests/UI/Effects/package_effect_value_covers_only_itself_is_e0740.jet:9:16
    |
  9 | backup: fn() -[Bucket{name: "photos"}]> { upload() }
    |                ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: The signature names `Bucket{name: "photos"}`, and a value of an effect covers only itself, so it doesn't cover another value of `Bucket`
 Fix: Add `Bucket{name: "logs"}` to `backup`'s row, write `Bucket` to allow every value, or stop calling the function that uses `Bucket{name: "logs"}`
 Denial: invocation
 Call chain: backup
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0740
